{"id":"2G","title":"Heathen Practices","part":{"n":2,"title":"Relationship to God"},"url":"/law/02-relationship-to-god/2g","entries":[{"id":"2G.1","text":"We are not to learn or follow the ways, customs or abominations of the heathen or of any ungodly nation.","refs":[{"book":"Leviticus","chapter":18,"verses":"3,26-30"},{"book":"Leviticus","chapter":20,"verses":"23"},{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":12,"verses":"29-31"},{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":18,"verses":"9-12"},{"book":"2 Kings","chapter":21,"verses":"1-7"},{"book":"2 Chronicles","chapter":36,"verses":"14"},{"book":"Jeremiah","chapter":10,"verses":"2"}],"citation":"Lev. 18:3, 26-30; Lev. 20:23; Deut 12:29-31; Deut 18:9-12; 2 Kings 21:1-7; 2 Chron. 36:14; Jer. 10:2."},{"id":"2G.2","text":"We are commanded not to worship, serve or sacrifice to the gods of the heathen.","refs":[{"book":"Exodus","chapter":23,"verses":"24"},{"book":"Leviticus","chapter":17,"verses":"7"},{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":6,"verses":"14"},{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":7,"verses":"16"},{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":11,"verses":"16"},{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":32,"verses":"16-17"},{"book":"Ezekiel","chapter":20,"verses":"30-32"}],"citation":"Exod. 23:24; Lev. 17:7; Deut. 6:14; Deut. 7:16; Deut. 11:16; Deut. 32:16-17; Ezek. 20:30-32."},{"id":"2G.3","text":"Witchcraft, wizardry, and sorcery condemned and forbidden to be practice.","refs":[{"book":"Exodus","chapter":22,"verses":"18"},{"book":"Leviticus","chapter":19,"verses":"31"},{"book":"Leviticus","chapter":20,"verses":"6,27"},{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":18,"verses":"10-11"},{"book":"1 Samuel","chapter":15,"verses":"23"},{"book":"2 Chronicles","chapter":33,"verses":"6"},{"book":"Isaiah","chapter":47,"verses":"9"},{"book":"Isaiah","chapter":57,"verses":"3"},{"book":"Micah","chapter":5,"verses":"12"},{"book":"Malachi","chapter":3,"verses":"5"},{"book":"Acts","chapter":13,"verses":"6-11"},{"book":"Galatians","chapter":5,"verses":"20"},{"book":"Revelation","chapter":21,"verses":"8"}],"citation":"Exod. 22:18; Lev. 19:31; Lev. 20:6, 27; Deut. 18:10-11; 1 Sam. 15:23; 2 Chron. 33:6; Isa. 47:9; Isa. 57:3; Mic. 5:12; Mal. 3:5; Acts 13:6-11; Gal. 5:20; Rev. 21:8; 22:15."},{"id":"2G.4","text":"Divination, soothsaying, and the use of mediums, spiritists and occultists are forbidden practices.","refs":[{"book":"Leviticus","chapter":19,"verses":"26,31"},{"book":"Leviticus","chapter":20,"verses":"6,27"},{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":18,"verses":"10-11"},{"book":"2 Chronicles","chapter":33,"verses":"6"},{"book":"Isaiah","chapter":47,"verses":"9-15"},{"book":"Ezekiel","chapter":12,"verses":"24"},{"book":"Micah","chapter":5,"verses":"12"}],"citation":"Lev. 19:26, 31; Lev. 20:6, 27; Deut 18:10-11; 2 Chron. 33:6; Isa. 47:9-15; Ezek. 12:24; Mic. 5:12."},{"id":"2G.5","text":"We are not to listen to diviners, enchanters, mediums or sorcerers.","refs":[{"book":"Isaiah","chapter":8,"verses":"19"},{"book":"Jeremiah","chapter":27,"verses":"9-10"},{"book":"Jeremiah","chapter":29,"verses":"8"}],"citation":"Isa. 8:19; Jer. 27:9-10; Jer. 29:8."},{"id":"2G.6","text":"Do not covenant with the heathen or their gods, or keep company with the heathen and idolaters.","refs":[{"book":"Exodus","chapter":23,"verses":"32-33"},{"book":"Exodus","chapter":34,"verses":"12,15"},{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":7,"verses":"2"},{"book":"Psalms","chapter":26,"verses":"5"},{"book":"1 Corinthians","chapter":5,"verses":"11"}],"citation":"Exod. 23:32-33; Exod. 34:12, 15; Deut. 7:2; Psa. 26:5; 1 Cor. 5:11."},{"id":"2G.7","text":"God desires the elimination of divination from the nation.","refs":[{"book":"Ezekiel","chapter":12,"verses":"23-24"}],"citation":"Ezek. 12:23-24."},{"id":"2G.8","text":"Divination and enchantments provoke God to anger.","refs":[{"book":"2 Kings","chapter":17,"verses":"17"}],"citation":"2 Kings 17:17."},{"id":"2G.9","text":"People are led astray and afflicted when guided by diviners instead of pastors.","refs":[{"book":"Zechariah","chapter":10,"verses":"2"}],"citation":"Zech. 10:2."},{"id":"2G.10","text":"We are not to sacrifice children to false gods or according to heathen practices.","refs":[{"book":"Leviticus","chapter":18,"verses":"21"},{"book":"Leviticus","chapter":20,"verses":"2-5"},{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":12,"verses":"31"},{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":18,"verses":"9-10"},{"book":"2 Kings","chapter":16,"verses":"3"},{"book":"Jeremiah","chapter":7,"verses":"31"},{"book":"Jeremiah","chapter":19,"verses":"5"},{"book":"Ezekiel","chapter":20,"verses":"31"}],"citation":"Lev. 18:21; Lev. 20:2-5; Deut 12:31; Deut 18:9-10; 2 Kings 16:3; Jer. 7:31; Jer. 19:5; Ezek. 20:31."}]}